---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { contact, site } from '@/config/site';

const email = `${contact.emailUser}@${contact.emailDomain}`;
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Alphalize collects, uses and protects the personal information you submit through this website."
  updated="3 September 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what personal information {site.legalName} collects through
    <strong>alphalize.com</strong>, why we collect it, and what we do with it. It covers this
    website only — separate terms apply to client engagements under contract.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information in two situations, both of which you initiate:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact enquiries.</strong> When you submit the contact form we receive your name,
      email address, phone number, subject and message.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Job applications.</strong> When you apply through the careers form we receive your
      name, email address, phone number, the role you applied for, your CV, and any message you
      add.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We also process a limited amount of technical data — your IP address and request headers — for
    the sole purposes of spam prevention and rate limiting on those two forms.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry.</li>
    <li>To assess your application for a role at Alphalize.</li>
    <li>To protect the forms from automated abuse.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell your information, we do not share it with advertisers, and we do not use it to
    send marketing you did not ask for.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Enquiries</strong> are retained for as long as needed to handle the conversation and any resulting engagement.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Applications and CVs</strong> are retained for up to 12 months so we can consider you
      for future openings. Ask us and we will delete yours sooner.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Rate-limiting records</strong> hold a counter against a hashed key and expire
      automatically within the hour.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who processes it</h2>
  <p>
    This site is hosted on Cloudflare. Form submissions are delivered by email through Resend, and
    submitted CVs are stored in Cloudflare R2. Spam protection uses Cloudflare Turnstile. These
    providers process the data on our behalf and are not permitted to use it for their own
    purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This website sets no advertising or tracking cookies and does not build a profile of you across
    sites. Cloudflare Turnstile may set a short-lived token on the pages that carry a form, solely
    to confirm the submission is not automated.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us for a copy of the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it,
    or ask us to delete it. Email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> and we will respond within
    a reasonable period.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> or {contact.phone}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
